{
  "description": "Legacy-owned (shadow) rollout completions. When the flux watcher sees a Kustomization finish, legacy synapse unions the ready jobs into pr_registry metadata.deployed_jobs (eligible jobs only) and then completes the Kustomization. Every HandleRolloutProgress it sends PRObject must carry those same ready jobs, so PRObject records the same deployed_jobs as the row. Regression: the completing tick sent deployed_jobs empty, leaving PRObject DeployedJobs null while the row had [\"prospera\"] (aerial#2301-#2303). On the completing tick the rollout progress is sent before the deploy_success verdict, so PRObject records the ready jobs while the PR is still deploying, in the order the legacy registry writes them.",
  "pr": {
    "repo": "azylman/aerial",
    "pr_number": 2302,
    "head_sha": "h2302",
    "merge_sha": "m2302",
    "target_id": "100000000000000001"
  },
  "setup": [
    {
      "object": "PRObject",
      "handler": "Register",
      "event": {
        "repo": "azylman/aerial",
        "pr_number": 2302,
        "branch": "feat/prospera",
        "head_sha": "h2302",
        "target_id": "100000000000000001",
        "title": "Prospera fix",
        "agent": "miorine",
        "bot_id": "miorine",
        "metadata": {
          "agent": "miorine",
          "bot_id": "miorine"
        }
      }
    },
